l dig deep into the three big investing themes our Macro team believes will (meaningfully) drive your portfolio returns in coming months.\r\n\r\nFYI—Quarterly Macro Themes is arguably our most important offering to subscribers. For years, it was exclusively available to our Institutional subscribers. We recently opened it up to our Macro Pro subscribers.\r\n\r\nTHIS IS OUR MOST CRITICAL &amp; CURRENT MACRO RESEARCH\r\n\r\nThis presentation includes our updated +115-page “Global Macro Outlook” slide deck and the resulting investment conclusions (including an updated G20 slide featuring our NEWLY RELEASED QUAD projections for 2Q 2023).\r\n\r\nAnyone interested in upgrading to Macro Pro will receive a pro-rated refund on their existing subscription. All you need to do is upgrade to Macro Pro here\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2022-06-24-29hzrzv/2dmxxc8/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n then email support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nmailto:support@hedgeye.com\r\n\r\n to get your pro-rated refund.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHEDGEYE IN THE NEWS\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t “There’s No Rush to Call a Market Bottom”\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/-contributors2Cmarket-insights/2dmxxcc/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n“When you’ve called every bear market since 2008, including the current one, you’ve earned the right to have strong, provocative opinions.”\r\n\r\nKeith McCullough, who is not a perma-bear, doesn’t hold back in this interview. Check out this new interview between Hedgeye Founder &amp; CEO Keith McCullough and Mark Bunting\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/MarkBunting-/2dmxxcg/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n, Publisher &amp; Host of Uncommon Sense Investor. It was originally published on Uncommon Sense Investor.\r\n\r\nThe CEO and Founder of Hedgeye Risk Management prepared his institutional clients and subscribers to preserve and grow their capital as his proprietary, data-driven, “go anywhere,” macro process sniffed out the stock market peak last year and the subsequent market downturn.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWATCH NOW\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/-contributors2Cmarket-insights/2dmxxcc/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n_____\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/thinkific-sso-login/2dmxxck/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTHE MACRO SHOW\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEurozone Continues To Struggle In #Quad4\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ratives-type-macro2Chedgeye-tv/2dmxxcn/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\nNo punches were pulled yesterday morning on The Macro Show\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2021-09-13-jj9wgv/2dmxxcr/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n when Hedgeye CEO Keith McCullough was asked whether Germany, Japan or China would be the biggest blowups in this bear market.\r\n\r\n“The thing about narratives—and why so many people bite on them and click on them—is that they require literally no knowledge to believe them,” explains McCullough. “The thing about numbers is that it takes a shitload of work and a lot of discipline.”\r\n\r\n“Don’t tell me how brilliant someone is, or what their SAT score is,” he adds. “Show me how they grind. Show me their process. Show me their routine. Show me their context. Show me every single word that comes out of their mouth mathematically when something that’s thrown at them is bullish. Then we’ll be talking about someone who gets my respect.”\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWATCH HERE\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ratives-type-macro2Chedgeye-tv/2dmxxcn/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n_____\r\n\r\n9 DAYS LEFT TO GET EARLY BIRD ALL ACCESS TICKETS\r\n\r\n​​​​​​\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/regional-ca-los-angeles/2dmxxcv/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\nABOUT HEDGEYE\r\n\r\nHedgeye Risk Management is an independent investment research and online financial media company, focused exclusively on generating and delivering thoughtful investment ideas in a proven buy-side process.  The firm combines quantitative, bottom-up and macro analysis with an emphasis on timing.  \r\n\r\nThe Hedgeye team features some of the most highly-regarded research analysts on Wall Street, covering Macro, Financials, Energy, Healthcare, Retail, Gaming, Lodging &amp; Leisure (GLL), Restaurants, Industrials, Consumer Staples, Internet &amp; Media, Housing, Materials, Technology, Demography and Washington policy analysis, including Macro, Energy, Healthcare, Telecom &amp; Media and Defense.\r\n\r\nUse of Hedgeye and any other products available through hedgeye.com\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/2022-08-03/2dmxxcy/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n are subject to our Terms of Service\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-o-/2dmxxd2/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n and Privacy Policy\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/t-d-l-xurkuhd-dlykxkyt-b-/2dmxxd5/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/Hedgeye/2dmxxd8/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n   \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/Hedgeye-/2dmxxdc/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n   \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/iption-center-add-user-hedgeye/2dmxxdg/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n      \r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/ny-hedgeye-risk-management-llc/2dmxxdk/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCopyright © 2022, All rights reserved.\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur mailing address is:\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHedgeye Risk Management LLC\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1 High Ridge Park\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStamford, CT 06905\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupdate subscription preferences\r\n\r\nhttps://info.hedgeye.com/hedgeye-email-preference-center?ehash=28e5ac2768859b27e0b97984a5d8375da495f57468d52861032537bebb56fdfd&email_id=883786735&epc_hash=udbE8RmRqvq1X3yEVamIG4efEBev-b8fdHxDKNeiF3Y\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n","attachment_id":null},"read_attachment_supported":null,"parts":null},{"part_id":"1","mime_type":"text/html","filename":"","headers":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"text/html; charset=\"utf-8\""},{"name":"Content-Transfer-Encoding","value":"8bit"}],"body":{"size":31812,"base64_url_content":null,"content":"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" />\r\n    <!-- Facebook sharing information tags -->\r\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"More Stock Losses Expected? --&gt; MID-QUARTER UPDATE NEXT WEEK\" />\r\n\r\n    <title>More Stock Losses Expected? --&gt; MID-QUARTER UPDATE NEXT WEEK</title>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body bgcolor=\"#FAFAFA\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; height: 100% !important; width: 100% !important; background-color: #FAFAFA; margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">#outlook a {\r\n              padding: 0;\r\n          }\r\n          .body{\r\n              width: 100% !important;\r\n              -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\r\n              -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;\r\n              margin: 0;\r\n              padding: 0;\r\n          }\r\n          .ExternalClass {\r\n              width:100%;\r\n          }\r\n          .ExternalClass,\r\n          .ExternalClass p,\r\n      