gn=\"left\" class=\"bodyContent\" pardot-data=\"line-height:23px;link-color:#2e9cf5;link-underline:underline;\" pardot-region=\"body_content02\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 23px; text-align: left; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoPlainText\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Our Founder and Risk-Manager-In-Chief<b> Keith McCullough</b> is hosting our highly anticipated 3Q 2022 Mid-Quarter Macro Themes presentation next Wednesday (8/10) at 11:00am ET. Keith will dig deep into the three big investing themes our Macro team believes will (meaningfully) drive your portfolio returns in coming months.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoPlainText\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">FYI<b>—Quarterly Macro Themes is arguably our most important offering to subscribers</b>. For years, it was exclusively available to our Institutional subscribers. We recently opened it up to our Macro Pro subscribers.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><b><i><span style=\"color:#00b050\">THIS IS OUR MOST CRITICAL &amp; CURRENT MACRO RESEARCH</span></i></b></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"background:yellow\"><span style=\"color:black\">This presentation includes our updated +115-page “Global Macro Outlook” slide deck and the resulting investment conclusions (including an updated G20 slide featuring our <strong>NEWLY RELEASED QUAD projections for 2Q 2023</strong>).</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><b><i><span style=\"color:black\">Anyone interested in upgrading to Macro Pro will receive a pro-rated refund on their existing subscription. All you need to do is upgrade to <a href=\"https://info.hedgeye.com/e/764243/l-764243-2022-06-24-29hzrzv/2dmxxc8/883786735?h=rX9y9vUGmM3uIr_tqjoB008uiKPBFg4O8gIvVj3FhSo\" style=\" color: #2e9cf5;\">Macro Pro here</a>&nbsp;then email <a href=\"mailto:support@hedgeye.com\" style=\"color: rgb(46, 156, 245); text-decoration: underline;\">support@hedgeye.com</a> to get your pro-rated refund.</span></i></b></span></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr pardot-repeatable=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" class=\"bodyContent\" pardot-data=\"line-height:1px;\" pardot-region=\"body_content02\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; background: rgb(234, 234, 234); color: rgb(80, 80, 80); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; text-align: left; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr pardot-repeatable=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"left\" class=\"bodyContent\" pardot-data=\"line-height:29px;link-color:#349EF3;link-underline:none;\" pardot-region=\"body_content02\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; color: rgb(52, 158, 243); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 29px; text-align: left; padding: 20px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><b>HEDGEYE IN THE NEWS<br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;“There’s No Rush to Call a Market Bottom”</b></span></span></span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr pardot-repeatable=\"\" style=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"lef